              <strong>3. Leading Citation:</strong> <em>Pulukuri Kottaya v. King-Emperor (1947 PC)</em>; <em>State of UP v. Deoman Upadhyaya (1960)</em>.<br>
              <strong>4. Authentic Repository:</strong> <a href="https://indiacode.nic.in" target="_blank" style="color:var(--accent-color); text-decoration:underline;">Bharatiya Sakshya Adhiniyam 2023 (indiacode.nic.in)</a>
            </div>
